# tests/fake-switches.patch: what the lab's fake Cisco IOS switch (fake-switches 1.5.0 from PyPI) needs for the Ansible
# plugin's example playbooks (cisco.ios over network_cli) and the e2e test: "show privilege", "terminal ..." and
# "end", the enable password under Python 3 (the configured passwords are bytes), and "spanning-tree vlan <list>
# priority <n>" in the configuration and in show running-config. Apply it in the package's site-packages directory:
#   patch -p1 -d <venv>/lib/python3.12/site-packages < install/rocky/tests/fake-switches.patch
